[1m[38;5;231mWhat should the app be built with?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mNo-build vanilla (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mPlain HTML + ES modules + CSS. No dependencies, no build step, opens straight in a browser. Suits the current [39m
     [38;5;246mscope; rewrite cost is low if it outgrows this.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m React + Vite
     [38;5;246mDeclarative components, standard tooling and testing. Adds node_modules and a build step, but scales cleanly if [39m
     [38;5;246mthis becomes a bigger app.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Svelte + Vite
     [38;5;246mCompiles away to small vanilla output, less boilerplate than React. Still a build step and a dependency tree.[39m
